    "body": "GFs and Characters now use one shared portrait selector built from the installed game's `face1.tim` and `face2.tim` sheets. The buttons show only the real in-game portraits; hover text identifies each one, and clicking one opens that record's live editable detail view. I checked all 27 portraits and both selection paths at 1280×720 and 1600×900. Restart LEXEDITOR once before checking it because the portrait URL is part of the FF8 service.",
